00:43:21.660 --> 00:43:22.480
A lógica de pausa,

00:43:22.560 --> 00:43:23.280
os sinais de integridade,

00:43:23.380 --> 00:43:24.540
a estrutura de grupos subjacentes

00:43:24.540 --> 00:43:25.180
